  "historyNote": "#5041, eff 1-9-91; amd by #5235, eff 9-27-91; rpld by 5894, eff 9-2-94 New. #6596, eff 10-3-97, EXPIRED: 10-3-05 New. #9287, eff 10-1-08; ss by #11067, eff 4-1-16",
